    "用手机相机扫它（手机要在你的 tailnet 里）：里面的验证码只能用一次，10 分钟内有效，手机会得到一把自己的钥匙。在那里“添加到主屏幕”，下次就方便了。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Scan it with the phone’s camera (the phone must be on your tailnet): the code in it works once, for 10 minutes, and the phone gets a key of its own. “Add to Home Screen” there for next time."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "用手机相机扫它：里面的验证码只能用一次，10 分钟内有效，手机会得到一把自己的钥匙。在那里“添加到主屏幕”，下次就方便了。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Scan it with the phone’s camera: the code in it works once, for 10 minutes, and the phone gets a key of its own. “Add to Home Screen” there for next time."
